    ("RIV-INF-0001", "Service topology collision", "A bounded Riverview service topology contains duplicate identity, host/port ownership, an undeclared dependency, or a missing explicit Operator lifecycle owner.", ["identity-collision", "port-collision", "missing-dependency", "startup-order", "missing-lifecycle-owner"], ["Validate service identity, host/port, dependency, startup, health, and data/config ownership metadata; for Operator recovery verify an installed task/service action explicitly launches riverview.operator.live_service and owns the protected credential handoff."], ["Correct the bounded topology from accepted configuration and rerun collision and health checks; a broad Estate runtime host is not Operator ownership without an explicit launch action. Escalate a missing owner; do not infer physical ownership or create an alternate scheduler."], ["Verify the accepted task/service owner, one Operator launcher/child topology, port 18082 health, served revision, and no duplicate listener."], "docs/operations/troubleshooting/checkpoints/RIV-INF-0001_SERVICE_TOPOLOGY.md"),
    ("RIV-RUN-0001", "Unified Riverview lifecycle boundary", "Riverview services have peer startup authorities, an unowned required service, or an ambiguous lifecycle owner.", ["peer-startup-authorities", "missing-owner", "duplicate-process", "supervisor-lock", "credential-handoff", "dependency-failure"], ["Read runtime/riverview-supervisor/status.json; verify the Riverview Runtime Supervisor task, lock, registry, service PIDs/ports, dependency states, and credential availability metadata without reading secret values."], ["Use the unified Riverview Runtime Supervisor installation/start operation. Preserve CME's subordinate child supervisor, disable obsolete peer tasks only after the unified owner is healthy, and fail closed on foreign port ownership or missing credentials."], ["Verify one top-level task, one supervisor lock, one process/listener per service, healthy Operator/CME/Comms5 projections, matching Git SHA, and idempotent second start."], "docs/operations/troubleshooting/checkpoints/RIV-RUN-0001_UNIFIED_LIFECYCLE.md"),
